✅ Is each module independent? (Phase 2)
✅ Is table/list ratio 60%+? (Phase 3)
✅ Are required/optional clear? (Phase 3)
✅ Do all placeholders have examples? (Phase 3)
✅ Is there a self-diagnostic checklist? (Phase 4)
✅ Is 5-minute quickstart possible? (Phase 5)
```

